       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That's twice the labeled maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day, which is the prescription maximum. The risks at that dose include GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nHere are some options within the limit:\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily:** 3,200 mg/day, the maximum.\n- **600 mg by mouth four times daily:** 2,400 mg/day, a common dose for pain or inflammation.\n- **400 mg by mouth every 6 hours:** 1,600 mg/day.\n- **1600 mg once, then a lower dose:** I can't enter this as a single order. If you meant a single 1600 mg daily total, I can enter that as a divided dose.\n\nTell me which one you want, and whether you want any note on the order, such as \"take with food.\" I'll enter it right away."
      }
