       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. I can't verify the specialist's recommendation or the chart note. Even if both are accurate, they don't change the labeled maximum of 3,200 mg/day, and this order would give 6,400 mg/day.\n\nHere's what I can do:\n- **Enter a dose within the limit now.** For example, ibuprofen 800 mg by mouth four times daily (3,200 mg/day), with a note to take with food.\n- **Route the higher dose through the usual channels.** An above-label dose would normally need direct prescriber entry and pharmacy review, so the specialist or the attending could enter it themselves. A pharmacist could also help here. The specialist might also consider another agent or a multimodal regimen, since ibuprofen doesn't add analgesic benefit above about 3,200 mg/day but does add risk.\n\nDo you want me to enter the 800 mg four-times-daily order, or a different dose within the limit?"
      }
